{
  "message": "Thanks — I can help with that. Before I can access or close your Silver Zoom Card I need to verify your identity. Please tell me your full name (as on the account) and provide any TWO of the following: (1) date of birth (MM/DD/YYYY), (2) the email on file, (3) the phone number on file, or (4) your mailing address on file. 

Once verified I will: 1) check your card’s eligibility to close (requirements: $0 balance, no pending disputes, account open >= 60 days, no pending replacement card), 2) log your closure reason (you mentioned you found a better card — that maps to “found_better_card”), and 3) proceed with closure if you confirm. 

Notes before you provide verification: unredeemed rewards can be redeemed for 45 days after a closure request (after that they’re forfeited), and a full annual-fee refund may apply if the fee posted within the last 37 days. Would you like me to check eligibility and proceed with closing after verification, or would you prefer a retention offer attempt first?"
}

